Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:04.80,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,350)}Before you…\Nshe was someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:09.90,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,350)}Then you happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:16.80,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,350)}She gave you her body first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:23.50,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,350)}Then hours of a pain doctors\Nrate above a broken bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:31.80,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,350)}And she forgot all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:39.80,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,350)}She packed herself away.\NQuietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:46.30,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,350)}Even her name\Nbecame “Mom”.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:53.80,Letter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,350)}Everything she was…\Nshe gave to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.80,Scene,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[She had dreams of her own.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:12.30,Scene,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Sick every morning.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.70,Scene,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Awake at 3 AM.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:16.80,Scene,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Her blood volume rose almost 50%.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:20.90,Scene,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Hour 2.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.90,0:00:23.50,Scene,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Hour 14.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:35.80,Scene,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Her dress. Her dancing shoes. Her drawings.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:39.80,Scene,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[She never told anyone.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:42.40,Scene,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Years went by.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.90,Scene,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[Years later, he found the box.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:53.80,Scene,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\i1}[He finally sees her.]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:09.90,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}SHE: {\i1}(whispering){\i0} Hi, little one…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:23.50,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}SHE: {\i1}(gasping){\i0} I can do this…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:25.60,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\i1}[baby crying]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:31.60,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}SHE: {\i1}(softly){\i0} Hi… I'm your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:42.40,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}KID: {\i1}(calling){\i0} Mom! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:44.60,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}SON: {\i1}(not looking){\i0} Mom, why don't you ever dress up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:46.30,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}MOM: {\i1}(smiling){\i0} I'm fine like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:56.90,Mid,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}SON: {\i1}(crying){\i0} Thank you, Ma.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.00,0:01:02.00,End,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,780)\fad(900,500)}Her body was\Nyour first home.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.80,0:01:02.00,End2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,500)}She gave you everything she was.\NRemind her who she is.
